  description: 'All monsters on the field lose 500 ATK and DEF, except Dinosaur-Type
    monsters. Once per turn, if a Dinosaur-Type monster is Normal or Special Summoned
    (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon 1 "Jurraegg Token" (Dinosaur-Type/EARTH/Level
    1/ATK 0/DEF 0) to your opponent''s field in Defense Position. While your opponent
    controls a Token, they cannot target monsters on the field with card effects,
    except Tokens. Once per turn, if a Normal Monster(s) on the field would be destroyed
    by battle or card effect, you can destroy that many Dinosaur-Type monsters in
    your hand and/or Deck instead.'
